            "review_title": "Review at Com Chay Mai Anh (vegetarian Restaurant)",
            "review_text": "Dave C\nAustin, Texas13 contributions\n0\nLow cost, great vegan restaurant\nFeb 2025 • Family\nI've been staying in the neighborhood for almost a month, and we've eaten at this small restaurant a couple of times a week. Every meal has been very good, and a great value for the price. The owner does the cooking, right in front of the tables. Ingredients are locally sourced, and fresh, so later in the day, the full menu may not be available. This is Vietnamese \"street food\" at its very best.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nArrive earlier in the evening for the full range of options. She closes up when she runs out of fresh ingredients each day.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 28, 2025",
